| **Happy Path** | Top-level, nested, and deeply nested keys; diverse value types |
| **Edge Cases** | Missing keys, falsy values (`0`, `False`, `[]`, `""`, `None`), intermediate non-dict values, empty dicts, empty-string keys from leading/trailing/consecutive dots |
| **Error Cases** | Non-dict `d` (returns default gracefully), non-string `keys` (raises `AttributeError`) |
